{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":20,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["露身赤腳的先知"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["亞述王撒珥根打發他珥探到亞實突的那年，他珥探就攻打亞實突，將城攻取。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那時，耶和華曉諭亞摩斯的兒子以賽亞說：「你去解掉你腰間的麻布，脫下你腳上的鞋。」以賽亞就這樣做，露身赤腳行走。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和華說：「我僕人以賽亞怎樣露身赤腳行走三年，作為關乎埃及和古實的預兆奇蹟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["照樣，亞述王也必擄去埃及人，掠去古實人，無論老少，都露身赤腳，現出下體，使埃及蒙羞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["以色列人必因所仰望的古實，所誇耀的埃及，驚惶羞愧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["「那時，這沿海一帶的居民必說：『看哪，我們素所仰望的，就是我們為脫離亞述王逃往求救的，不過是如此！我們怎能逃脫呢？』」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/20.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/21.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/19.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}